msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32399"
msgid "Manage show and movie titles"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32400"
msgid "Replace show and movie titles with the title in the source folder's language from TMDB (and TheTVDB for shows), for example when a Dutch folder was scraped in English. Only a title the provider really has in that language is used; there is no fallback language. Titles from an NFO file are kept, and so are titles of items without a TMDB or IMDb id."
msgstr ""

